<details>
  <summary>What's the difference between Free and Pro?</summary>
  <p>Free covers saving, finding and syncing your highlights. Pro adds the AI features: AI Access for your AI tools, and on-device AI context.</p>
</details>
<details>
  <summary>Is Pro a subscription?</summary>
  <p>No. Pro will be a one-time purchase through the App Store. It doesn't include an AI tool or any fees from its provider.</p>
</details>
